{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>天氣概況：一股清勁的偏東氣流正影響廣東沿岸。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：初時天色大致良好。日間部分時間有陽光，最高氣溫約30度。晚上有一兩陣微雨。吹和緩東風，風勢間中清勁。</p><p></p><p>展望：明日有一兩陣雨。重陽節初時雲量仍然較多，稍後至下週初漸轉天晴乾燥。下週中期日間炎熱。</p><p></p><p>05:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T01:44:54.352804+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T22:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T01:59:09.355107+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:47.680580+00:00","content_hash":"a5ccd29970bcd5ea1f828a78b5e4f6630bba0c78d92d69d089319c513e3127b2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}